From eefe6bfdcd9ca9d0db800299f39dc4ec9ada8195 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 08:16:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add floating contact and scroll-to-top buttons on every page

Fixed bottom-right stack of two small round buttons, present on all
12 pages: a red envelope icon linking to contact.html, and a navy
up-arrow that appears once the page has been scrolled 400px and
smooth-scrolls back to top on click (instant for
prefers-reduced-motion). Same site.js file handles it everywhere
since every page already loads it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
